h1 class="type-wide max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(2.6rem,8.4vw,8.75rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.03em]" data-ph-title="true" id="page-title">Visit &amp; Book</h1><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-bone/20 pt-5 lg:mt-9 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div class="flex items-end gap-6"><button aria-label="Scroll to the next section" class="group/cue hidden items-center sm:flex" data-ph-fade="true" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative block h-10 w-px overflow-hidden bg-bone/25"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 block h-1/2 animate-scroll-cue bg-bone"></span></span></button><p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.2vw,2rem)] italic leading-snug text-bone/90" data-ph-fade="true">Seventy minutes from Lisbon, a world away from it.</p></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-8 lg:shrink-0" data-ph-fade="true"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">From Lisbon</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">70 min</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Helipad</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">On site</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">The beach</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">12 min</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="visit-intro-label" class="relative z-10 -mt-px overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.75rem] bg-bone text-charcoal shadow-[0_-30px_70px_-20px_rgba(9,17,12,0.55)] sm:rounded-t-[2.5rem]" id="visit-intro"><div class="px-5 pb-24 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-28"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70" id="visit-intro-label"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Getting here</span></h2><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">38°11′ N · 8°47′ W</p></div><p class="mt-12 max-w-[68rem] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16 [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" data-intro-statement="true">Seventy minutes from Lisbon, <em>a world away</em> from it. Most guests arrive by car, and a few by helicopter onto the estate’s own pad.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75 lg:col-span-4" data-reveal="true">However you come, the concierge team will have your bag on a cart and your first tee time confirmed before you reach the gate.</p><div class="lg:col-span-8"><dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">by car from Lisbon Airport</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="70" data-decimals="0">70</span> min</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">by helicopter to the estate helipad</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="20" data-decimals="0">20</span> min</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">on foot from the clubhouse to the beach</dt><dd class